{"title":"Hot Cocoa","slug":"Hot_Cocoa","hero":{"file":"Cocoa.webp","width":400,"height":400},"pageid":1967,"revid":13800,"timestamp":"2024-07-09T15:35:19Z","lastEditor":"Handsome.Businessman","categories":["Items","Event_Items"],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay"},{"label":"Shop","value":"The Oak Depot"},{"label":"Price","value":"$900"},{"label":"Function","value":"Decoration"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"1.45.0"}]},"sections":[{"id":"hot-cocoa","text":"Hot Cocoa"},{"id":"appearance","text":"Appearance"},{"id":"gallery","text":"Gallery"}],"body":"<p><i><big>\"Warm up your day with a delightful cup of Hot Cocoa.\"</big></i>\n</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"hot-cocoa\">Hot Cocoa</h2>\n<p>Limited item in 2023 Christmas Update. This item can also spawn in <b>Gift Landings</b>, the <b>Christmas Update</b>'s version of <b><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Meteor_Core/\">Meteor Crashes</a></b>.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"appearance\">Appearance</h2>\n<p>Hot Cocoa is an ornamented red cup of cocoa with floating pieces of marshmallows inside. It uses Roblox gear \"Hot Chocolate\" as it's model.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"gallery\">Gallery</h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"f67dead357dbab26870ca802f8a38aa5\" data-seq-no=\"0\"><div></div><div><div><div id=\"Limited_in_Oak_Depot-png\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Hot Cocoa in Oak Depot\">Hot Cocoa in Oak Depot</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Hot Cocoa in Oak Depot\">Hot Cocoa in Oak Depot</span></span></div></div><div>Hot Cocoa in Oak Depot</div></div></div>"}
